    "speaker": "guest",
    "thought": "t9"
   },
   {
    "id": "sentence:source:114.83-120.09",
    "sentence_id": "sentence:source:114.83-120.09",
    "src": "/home/user/new-project-money/.nexus/benchmarks/documentary/source.mp4",
    "start": 114.83,
    "end": 120.09,
    "action": "keep",
    "kind": "sentence",
    "reason": "kept: importance 90.4, role hook, hook",
    "score": 53.7,
    "confidence": 0.7,
    "text": "and several dark spots, apparently mountain peaks protruding up through the storm.",
    "speaker": "guest",
    "thought": "t9"
   },
   {
    "id": "sentence:source:121.81-129.73",
    "sentence_id": "sentence:source:121.81-129.73",
    "src": "/home/user/new-project-money/.nexus/benchmarks/documentary/source.mp4",
    "start": 121.81,
    "end": 129.73,
    "action": "keep",
    "kind": "sentence",
    "reason": "kept: importance 90.4, role hook, hook",
    "score": 54.8,
    "confidence": 0.7,
    "text": "And then the great clouds of dust receded, and the long weeks of frustration ended with one magnificent and exciting word,",
    "speaker": "guest",
    "thought": "t9"
   },
   {
    "id": "sentence:source:94.86-103.94",
    "sentence_id": "sentence:source:94.86-103.94",
    "src": "/home/user/new-project-money/.nexus/benchmarks/documentary/source.mp4",
    "start": 94.86,
    "end": 103.94,
    "action": "keep",
    "kind": "sentence",
    "reason": "kept: importance 92.9",
    "score": 74.3,
    "confidence": 0.7,
    "text": "When Mariner 9 was placed into an orbit around Mars, it saw a planet one half the size of Earth, blanketed by a gigantic dust storm.",
    "speaker": "guest",
    "thought": "t8"
   },
   {
    "id": "sentence:source:187.74-195.18",
    "sentence_id": "sentence:source:187.74-195.18",
    "src": "/home/user/new-project-money/.nexus/benchmarks/documentary/source.mp4",
    "start": 187.74,
    "end": 195.18,
    "action": "keep",
    "kind": "sentence",
    "reason": "kept: importance 91.1",
    "score": 72.9,
    "confidence": 0.7,
    "text": "The exploration of Mars by early mariners photographed about 10 % of the surface in brief encounters as they flew past the planet.",
    "speaker": "guest",
    "thought": "t14"
   },
   {
    "id": "sentence:source:199.12-204.36",
    "sentence_id": "sentence:source:199.12-204.36",
    "src": "/home/user/new-project-money/.nexus/benchmarks/documentary/source.mp4",
    "start": 199.12,
    "end": 204.36,
    "action": "keep",
    "kind": "sentence",
    "reason": "kept: importance 91.4",
    "score": 73.1,
    "confidence": 0.7,
    "text": "But it is Mariner 9 that explores all of Mars and reveals a planet beyond speculation.",
    "speaker": "guest",
    "thought": "t15"
   },
   {
    "id": "sentence:source:208.02-215.82",
    "sentence_id": "sentence:source:208.02-215.82",
    "src": "/home/user/new-project-money/.nexus/benchmarks/documentary/source.mp4",
    "start": 208.02,
    "end": 215.82,
    "action": "keep",
    "kind": "sentence",
    "reason": "kept: importance 88.0",
    "score": 70.4,
    "confidence": 0.7,
    "text": "The intricate spacecraft operating at a distance of over 100 million miles is commanded by a complex system of men and machines on Earth.",
    "speaker": "guest",
    "thought": "t16"
   },
   {
    "id": "sentence:source:225.64-233.58",
    "sentence_id": "sentence:source:225.64-233.58",
    "src": "/home/user/new-project-money/.nexus/benchmarks/documentary/source.mp4",
    "start": 225.64,
    "end": 233.58,
    "action": "keep",
    "kind": "sentence",
    "reason": "kept: importance 86.0",
    "score": 68.8,
    "confidence": 0.7,
    "text": "As the spacecraft orbits Mars, the density of the atmosphere is measured by radio waves as they pass through the atmosphere on their way to Earth.",
    "speaker": "guest",
    "thought": "t19"
   },
   {
    "id": "sentence:source:235.12-240.78",
    "sentence_id": "sentence:source:235.12-240.78",
    "src": "/home/user/new-project-money/.nexus/benchmarks/documentary/source.mp4",
    "start": 235.12,
    "end": 240.78,
    "action": "keep",
    "kind": "sentence",
    "reason": "kept: importance 80.1",
    "score": 64.1,
    "confidence": 0.7,
    "text": "The thin Martian clouds are scanned in the infrared to determine if they are carbon dioxide or water.",
    "speaker": "guest",
    "thought": "t20"
   },
   {
    "id": "sentence:source:242.79-253.99",
    "sentence_id": "sentence:source:242.79-253.99",
    "src": "/home/user/new-project-money/.nexus/benchmarks/documentary/source.mp4",
    "start": 242.79,
    "end": 253.99,
    "action": "keep",
    "kind": "sentence",
    "reason": "kept: importance 87.8",
    "score": 70.2,
    "confidence": 0.7,
    "text": "An infrared instrument continually measures the changes in surface temperatures, ranging from minus 150 degrees Fahrenheit on the night side to as high as 70 degrees at noon on the equator.",
    "speaker": "guest",
    "thought": "t21"
   },
   {
    "id": "sentence:source:268.58-274.48",
    "sentence_id": "sentence:source:268.58-274.48",
    "src": "/home/user/new-project-money/.nexus/benchmarks/documentary/source.mp4",
    "start": 268.58,
    "end": 274.48,
    "action": "keep",
    "kind": "sentence",
    "reason": "kept: importance 80.8",
    "score": 65.9,
    "confidence": 0.7,
    "text": "Analysis of subtle changes in the orbit of Mariner reveals that Mars has an odd bulging shape.",
    "speaker": "guest",
    "thought": "t23"
   },
   {
    "id": "sentence:source:275.26-278.42",
    "sentence_id": "sentence:source:275.26-278.42",
    "src": "/home/user/new-project-money/.nexus/benchmarks/documentary/source.mp4",
    "start": 275.26,
    "end": 278.42,
    "action": "keep",
    "kind": "sentence",
    "reason": "kept: importance 80.8",
    "score": 53.6,
    "confidence": 0.7,
    "text": "And this shape is a new clue to its internal structure.",
    "speaker": "guest",
    "thought": "t23"
   },
   {
    "id": "sentence:source:278.42-283.67",
    "sentence_id": "sentence:source:278.42-283.67",
    "src": "/home/user/new-project-money/.nexus/benchmarks/documentary/source.mp4",
    "start": 278.42,
    "end": 283.67,
    "action": "keep",
    "kind": "sentence",
    "reason": "kept: importance 93.4",
    "score": 74.7,
    "confidence": 0.7,
    "text": "Two television cameras photograph and map the surface of Mars.",
    "speaker": "guest",
    "thought": "t24"
   },
   {
    "id": "sentence:source:284.99-289.17",
    "sentence_id": "sentence:source:284.99-289.17",
    "src": "/home/user/new-project-money/.nexus/benchmarks/documentary/source.mp4",
    "start": 284.99,
    "end": 289.17,
    "action": "keep",
    "kind": "sentence",
    "reason": "kept: importance 87.8",
    "score": 70.2,
    "confidence": 0.7,
    "text": "In nearly a year of operation, they transmit more than 7 ,000 photographs.",
    "speaker": "guest",
    "thought": "t25"
   },
   {
    "id": "sentence:source:294.23-299.51",
    "sentence_id": "sentence:source:294.23-299.51",
    "src": "/home/user/new-project-money/.nexus/benchmarks/documentary/source.mp4",
